# Build-context exclusions for the landing-fusion frontend image
# (build context: projects/landing-fusion).
# Host node_modules/dist are never copied into the image — the Dockerfile
# installs dependencies itself, and copying the host's pnpm symlink layout
# over the container's real directories breaks BuildKit overlay materialization
# ("cannot replace to directory ... with file").
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.git
**/logs
**/.env
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
